{"_id":"Qas0jCrPEtAcnP2K","name":"Cybernetic Diagnostic Scanner","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/cybernetic_diagnostic_scanner.png","system":{"description":"<p>Allows the user to scan androids and other cybernetic organisms in order to diagnose any physical or mental issues they may be having. Often distrusted by androids.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":2000},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"uLxeKM2d4EgTUefj","name":"Defibrillator","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/defibrillator.png","system":{"description":"<p>A device that send an electric pulse or shock to the heart to restore a normal heartbeat.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":160},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"kWAgoLy1AuhUln9f","name":"Dog","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/dog.png","system":{"description":"<p>A subspecies of the gray wolf, dogs are known to be faithful and loyal companions, protective of their masters and territory.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":14000},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"bZXAik9TR0GjWjy7","name":"Drill","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/drill.png","system":{"description":"<p>A power tool that's used for making narrow holes or sometimes for pushing screws into wood or other hard material.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":75},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"7vPESNSPggZYeHfP","name":"Duct Tape","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/duct_tape.png","system":{"description":"<p>A long-lasting adhesive tape which can be easily torn by hand. It's suitable for indoor and outdoor use thanks to its strength and water resistance.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":5},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"4YWdcVso4Gp3luql","name":"Electronic Tool Set","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/electronic_tool_set.png","system":{"description":"<p>A full set of tools for doing detailed repair or construction work on electronics.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":100},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"geMpXYReDElSPrQo","name":"Emergency Beacon","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/emergency_beacon.png","system":{"description":"<p>A small device that sends up a flare and then emits a loud beep every few seconds. Additionally, sends out a call on all radio channels to ships or vehicles in the area, but can be blocked by a <strong>radio jammer</strong>.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":2000},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"rMZHIG9ADcgWdj2W","name":"Exoloader","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/exoloader.png","system":{"description":"<p>Open-air mechanical exoskeleton used for heavy lifting <em>(up to 5000kg).</em> Loader claws deal 1 Wound. User can only wear Standard Crew Attire or Standard Battle Dress while operating. <strong>Battery</strong> operated <em>(48 hours of use).</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":100000},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"u2rWP6CUonlVFx8F","name":"Explosives & Detonator","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/explosives_&_detonator.png","system":{"description":"<p>Explosive charge powerful enough to blow open an airlock. All organisms in Close Range must make a Body Save or take a Wound (Explosive). Detonator works at Long Range, but can be blocked by a <strong>radio jammer</strong>.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":500},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"S7coVq4M5Fx6pVYP","name":"Extension Cord (20m)","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/extension_cord_20m.png","system":{"description":"<p>A length of flexible electrical power cable with a plug on one end and one or more sockets on the other end.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":12},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"jzLUYOVovXJczeMo","name":"Filter Mask","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/filter_mask.png","system":{"description":"<p>An air-purifying respirators protects by filtering particles out of the air the user is breathing.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":5},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"tYCPdFuS7NEzQwYk","name":"First Aid Kit","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/first_aid_kit.png","system":{"description":"<p>An assortment of dressings and treatments to help stop bleeding, bandage cuts, and treat other minor injuries.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":75},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"FRkzMfESfYIbIlnF","name":"Flashlight","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/flashlight.png","system":{"description":"<p>Handheld or shoulder mounted. Illuminates 10m ahead of the user.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":30},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"CIsm21PwRxoId4YK","name":"Foldable Stretcher","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/foldable_stretcher.png","system":{"description":"<p>Portable stretcher that can fit within a <strong>rucksack</strong>. Allows the user to safely strap down the patient and carry them to a location where their wounds can be better treated. Unfolds to roughly 2m.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":150},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"mfdfOUEzf4B8YCEB","name":"Geiger Counter","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/geiger_counter.png","system":{"description":"<p>Detects <strong>radiation</strong> and displays radiation levels.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":20},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"Q1hHUY7nxQL3Nwxs","name":"Head Lamp","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/head_lamp.png","system":{"description":"<p>A lamp attached to the front of a vehicle to illuminate the road ahead.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":10},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"DkMgyZ7cAAafwyI7","name":"Heads-Up Display (HUD)","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/heads_up_display_hud.png","system":{"description":"<p>Often worn by marines, the HUD allows the wearer to see through the <strong>body cams</strong> of others in their unit, and can connect to any <strong>smart-link</strong> upgaded weapon.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":100},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"Paw9q0OG6YIl5941","name":"Infrared Goggles","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/infrared_goggles.png","system":{"description":"<p>Allows the wearer to see heat signatures, sometimes up to several hours old. Add <strong>night vision</strong> for <em>(+300cr).</em></p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":1500},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"gfVTHeZfTb0s7uDJ","name":"Jetpack","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/jetpack.png","system":{"description":"<p>Allows wearer to fly up to 100m high and up to a speed of 100km/hr for 2 hours on a tank of fuel. Deals [[/r {1d100,1d100}kh]]{1d100 [+]} DMG if destroyed. Fuel can be refilled for 200cr.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":75000},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"TDMc9O2A2XOTKlhf","name":"Jump-9 Ticket","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/jump_9_ticket.png","system":{"description":"<p>A document with a price showing the cost of space travel, passenger name, and journey details.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":450},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"4ZD7sSOQGFJrue8P","name":"Leash","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/leash.png","system":{"description":"<p>A strap or cord for restraining and guiding a dog or other animal.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":10},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"GPeQpFIBuQIrKzX0","name":"Lockpick Set","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/lockpick_set.png","system":{"description":"<p>A highly advanced set of tools meant for hacking basic airlock and electronic door systems.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":40},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"N1YM0lWScmP3RHRP","name":"Long-range Comms","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/long_range_comms.png","system":{"description":"<p>Rucksack-sized communication device for use in surface-to-ship comunication.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":1000},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"QkjC2vIg0oPEtg9S","name":"Lunch Box","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/lunch_box.png","system":{"description":"<p>A hand-held container used to transport food.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":15},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"uHPFcNQEA0amUJQJ","name":"Mag-boots","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/mag_boots.png","system":{"description":"<p>Grants a magnetic grip to the wearer, allowing them to easily walk on the exterior of a ship <em>(in space, while docked, or free-floating)</em>, metal-based asteroids, or any other magnetic surface.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":350},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"yaZdtvAEVqT0eb6K","name":"Medscanner","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/medscanner.png","system":{"description":"<p>Allows the user to scan a living or dead body to analyze it for disease or abnormalities, without having to do a biopsy or autopsy. Results may not be instaneous and may require a lab for complete analysis.</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":8000},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"RsP6YrrM1wissP5K","name":"MoHab Unit","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/mohab_unit.png","system":{"description":"<p><strong>Tent, canteen, stove, rucksack, compass,</strong> and <strong>sleeping bag.</strong></p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":1000},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id":"XJvPld6W5IHUSMxo","name":"MRE","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/mre.png","system":{"description":"<p>\u201cMeal, Ready-to-Eat.\u201d Self-contained, individual field rations in lightweight packaging. Each one has sufficient sustenance for a single person for one day <em>(does not include water).</em></p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":10},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
