{"_id":"EkA39xa1vq6SghtP","name":"Stimpak","type":"item","img":"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_psg/icons/equipment/stimpak.png","system":{"description":"<p>Cures cryosickness, reduces 1 Stress <em>(or increases 1d10 Calm)</em>, restores 1d10 Health, and grants [+] to all rolls for [[/r 1d10]] min.<br><br>Roll [[/r 1d10]]. If you roll under the amount of doses you\u2019ve taken in the past 24 hours, make a <strong>Death Save</strong>.<br><br>@UUID[Compendium.mosh.macros_triggered_1e.qbq694JMbXeZrHjj]{-1 Stress} or @UUID[Compendium.mosh.macros_triggered_1e.k2TtLFOG9mGaWVx3]{+1d10 Calm}<br><br>@UUID[Compendium.mosh.macros_triggered_1e.f8Q9FCZsnUyAbczE]{+1d10 Health}<br><br>@UUID[Compendium.mosh.macros_hotbar_1e.NsRHfRuuNGPfkYVf]{Death Save}</p>","quantity":1,"weight":0,"cost":1000},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"sort":0,"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
